5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our growth remains sustainable and our peace of mind intact, I wish to examine the appraisal needs at the last audit and independent checks on holdings' reported figures.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that transparency is key. To understand the actual drivers of our returns, I want to look into the profile of the exits and the write-off, as well as account retention through price rises.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must prioritize our long-term financial stability. I will look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to get started! I really want to make sure we aren't overstretching ourselves with the workload, so I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should be mindful of operational friction. I will look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such a diverse range of priorities. By covering both the operational and the financial facets, we ensure that our next step is taken with wisdom and a clear heart.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Diversity is useful, but we must ensure we aren't ignoring the gap between our narrative and reality. I believe the data on retention and exits will provide the necessary grounding for our final decision.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Indeed. While narrative is important, the actual liquidity available for future commitments is what will determine if we can actually support the companies we choose. I look forward to seeing how our findings align.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I totally agree! It's like making sure we have enough energy for a big adventure! I can't wait to see if our support team is ready to jump in and help the new company grow!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. While financial stability and human resources are essential, the speed of execution is where most plans fail. I want to see if there are recurring patterns of delay that we have overlooked.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, but so is preparation. As we await the results of our inquiries, let us remember that the numbers are merely a reflection of the human effort and spirit behind them.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Numbers are objective, Servas. I am less interested in the spirit and more interested in whether our previous successes were based on sustainable customer loyalty or mere market timing. That is the only way to avoid repeating mistakes.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Objectivity is necessary, but it must be applied to our own capacity as well. If we lack the capital to follow through on our promises, the most sustainable business model in the world won't save the investment.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,You're all so serious! But that's why we make a great team! I just hope we find a company that doesn't need us to spend every single waking hour hunting for new hires!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"The tension between sustainability and speed is always present. I am simply interested in the reality of the timeline. If the path to the first customer is blocked by external friction, the business model becomes irrelevant.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us embrace these different perspectives. Whether we seek speed, stability, or spirit, we all strive for the same goal: a legacy of success. I look forward to the insights we shall uncover together.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I hope the data reveals the truth, regardless of whether it fits our current narrative. I am ready to move forward once the findings are available.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us proceed to the findings. I will be analyzing the data with a focus on our actual capacity to sustain this investment over the coming years.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Mio,,Me too! I'm ready to dive in and see what's what! Let's hope for some great news that makes our lives easier and the companies happier!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will be waiting for the results. I intend to see if the delays we have experienced in the past are systemic or merely coincidental. Let us see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
